WEBVTT

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:06.980
Well, no, no, no, I've never really thought about that.

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:18.420
I feel that the more money a person has, the more needs they create within themselves.

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:25.720
Even if they're things that everyone else sees as, let's say, stupid,

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:39.900
they're things that person keeps creating in their mind, simply because the more money you acquire, the more you feel the need for power, to have more.

00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:45.100
So it's like a question of how much money you'd need to live the rest of your life.

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:50.600
Let's say, for example, that I need a billion pesos to live the rest of my life.

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.640
And you give it to me, a million dollars.

00:00:55.060 --> 00:00:56.320
And you give me the million dollars.

00:00:57.300 --> 00:00:59.820
alright, once I have it

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:03.800
I think I'll start thinking about buying a million-dollar mansion

00:01:04.699 --> 00:01:06.780
and I'm going to need another million dollars

00:01:08.379 --> 00:01:11.080
so I think it's a question that wouldn't have an answer

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:15.360
so I don't sit around thinking how much I'd need for my life

00:01:15.640 --> 00:01:17.000
more than anything I need to be happy

00:01:17.999 --> 00:01:20.620
to laugh and make a lot of music, a lot of music

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:22.839
that I do need, a lot of love

00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:23.680
Hehehehe.
